{"task_id": "HumanEval/57", "solution": "def monotonic(l: list):\n    \"\"\"Return True is list elements are monotonically increasing or decreasing.\"\"\"\n\n    def _is_increasing(lst: list) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"Checks if a list is monotonically increasing.\"\"\"\n        if len(lst) < 2:\n            return True\n        for i in range(1, len(lst)):\n            if lst[i] < lst[i-1]:\n                return False\n        return True\n\n    def _is_decreasing(lst: list) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"Checks if a list is monotonically decreasing.\"\"\"\n        if len(lst) < 2:\n            return True\n        for i in range(1, len(lst)):\n            if lst[i] > lst[i-1]:\n                return False\n        return True\n\n    return _is_increasing(l) or _is_decreasing(l)"}
